// 26 U.S.C. §1274 — statutory note 4 (effectivedate-amendment-note)
fragment IRC_S1274_NOTE_4 in IRC_2024_EDITION {
    kind note;
    locator "section/1274/note/4";
    text en official """Effective Date of 1997 Amendment
Amendment by Pub. L. 105–34 applicable to sales and exchanges after May 6, 1997, with certain exceptions, see section 312(d) of Pub. L. 105–34, set out as a note under section 121 of this title.
