// 26 U.S.C. §1101to1103 — [§§1101 to 1103. Repealed. Pub. L. 101–508, title XI, §11801(a)(34), Nov. 5, 1990, 104 Stat. 1388–521]
fragment IRC_S1101TO1103 in IRC_2024_EDITION {
